cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "kla: Kalman Linear Attention"
abstract: >-
  A linear-attention layer that runs an exact parallel Kalman filter over the
  sequence: each token is a noisy observation and the output is the filtered
  posterior mean (optionally its variance). Trains as parallel associative
  scans with O(L log L) training and O(1)-per-token recurrent decoding.
type: software
license: MIT
